 21 │ On March 15th, we are thrilled to welcome Dr. John Smith (pseudonym), an expert in exoplanetary science from the University of Astrology (hypothetical institution). Dr. Smith will present a lecture titled "The Search for Other Worlds" at our club hall starting at 7:00 PM. The event is free and open to all members, their families, and interested guests.
    · ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
