 22 │ 
 23 │ Dr. Smith’s research focuses on advanced methods used in the detection of exoplanets, including direct imaging techniques and transit photometry. His lecture will cover recent discoveries and future prospects for finding life beyond our solar system. We encourage everyone to attend this enlightening event, which promises to deepen our understanding of what lies outside our own cosmic neighborhood.
